    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Introduction:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWelcome, enthusiasts of strategy and kingdom management! &quot;World Strategy War&quot; is a strategy game that awaits you to imprint your name in the history books. Build your own kingdom, manage your army, and rise to the pinnacle of competition among kingdoms on different islands.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDiverse Islands to Explore:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnique challenges and advantages await in cities and resources on different islands.<br />\r\nStar gates for inter-island transitions challenge your strategic mobility.<br />\r\nRoyal Families and Successions:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach state has a king and soldiers from the royal family.<br />\r\nIn case of the king's demise, a member of the royal family can ascend, prompting a reassessment of your strategy.<br />\r\nAging Soldiers and Special Abilities:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSoldiers age and naturally die at different ages if they don't fall in battle.<br />\r\nEach soldier has unique abilities and experiences, shaping your strategy accordingly.<br />\r\nAdvanced City Structures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBuild structures like castles, hospitals, forges, mines, and barracks.<br />\r\nResources from mines, processed by forges, produce powerful weapons and armor.<br />\r\nEconomic Management and Tax Policies:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nManage your economy with taxes collected from each city.<br />\r\nAdjust tax levels for increased loyalty and minimized rebellion risks.<br />\r\nStrategic Warfare and City Conquests:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTreat wounded soldiers in hospitals after battles.<br />\r\nCapture prisoners, put them to work in mines, or negotiate ransoms.<br />\r\nSeizing soldiers within castles increases the difficulty of capturing cities.<br />\r\nDiplomacy and Espionage:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMake peace or form alliances with other states through envoys.<br />\r\nAgents can spy on enemy units or carry out assassinations for additional strategic advantages.<br />\r\nIn &quot;World Strategy War,&quot; employ your intelligence, strategic thinking, and kingdom management skills. Build your own kingdom and become the master of inter-kingdom warfare in this enchanting world of strategy!",
    "about_the_game": "Introduction:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWelcome, enthusiasts of strategy and kingdom management! &quot;World Strategy War&quot; is a strategy game that awaits you to imprint your name in the history books. Build your own kingdom, manage your army, and rise to the pinnacle of competition among kingdoms on different islands.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDiverse Islands to Explore:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnique challenges and advantages await in cities and resources on different islands.<br />\r\nStar gates for inter-island transitions challenge your strategic mobility.<br />\r\nRoyal Families and Successions:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach state has a king and soldiers from the royal family.<br />\r\nIn case of the king's demise, a member of the royal family can ascend, prompting a reassessment of your strategy.<br />\r\nAging Soldiers and Special Abilities:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSoldiers age and naturally die at different ages if they don't fall in battle.<br />\r\nEach soldier has unique abilities and experiences, shaping your strategy accordingly.<br />\r\nAdvanced City Structures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBuild structures like castles, hospitals, forges, mines, and barracks.<br />\r\nResources from mines, processed by forges, produce powerful weapons and armor.<br />\r\nEconomic Management and Tax Policies:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nManage your economy with taxes collected from each city.<br />\r\nAdjust tax levels for increased loyalty and minimized rebellion risks.<br />\r\nStrategic Warfare and City Conquests:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTreat wounded soldiers in hospitals after battles.<br />\r\nCapture prisoners, put them to work in mines, or negotiate ransoms.<br />\r\nSeizing soldiers within castles increases the difficulty of capturing cities.<br />\r\nDiplomacy and Espionage:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMake peace or form alliances with other states through envoys.<br />\r\nAgents can spy on enemy units or carry out assassinations for additional strategic advantages.<br />\r\nIn &quot;World Strategy War,&quot; employ your intelligence, strategic thinking, and kingdom management skills. Build your own kingdom and become the master of inter-kingdom warfare in this enchanting world of strategy!",
